{
  "dom_id": "step-36133",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Determining the Infinite Domain of a Function From Its Graph",
  "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14192268/assets/424ba7888faf0cd8503f562664da2d87595680e79b91acbefa5f1e3e79b81776.png)\n\nWhat is the domain of the function shown above?",
  "worked_solution": "The function above is defined for all values of $x$ that are less than $x = 3.$\n\nIn addition, since there is a closed circle at $x = 3,$ this point is included in the domain.\n\nTherefore, the domain of this function is $x \\leq 3,$ which we can write as $x \\in (-\\infty, 3].$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-36133\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"36133\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"9641\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-36133\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-12\">Determining the Infinite Domain of a Function From Its Graph</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"36133\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <div id=\"graphic-89a3ed5e511564d6feffade56f7f179a\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/89a3ed5e511564d6feffade56f7f179a\"></div>\n\n<p>What is the domain of the function shown above?</p>\n\n            </div>     \n\n            <div class=\"explanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div>\n\n            <div class=\"exampleExplanation\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\